00:00:02.00,00:00:03.81
SKERRY POINT LIGHTHOUSE

00:00:04.21,00:00:07.21
- Marta. The lamp is out.[br]- The lamp is not out.

00:00:07.61,00:00:10.23
It is dark, Marta. That is what out means.

00:00:10.63,00:00:12.63
- It is resting.[br]- It is a lamp.

00:00:13.03,00:00:14.85
Everything rests. Even lamps.

00:00:15.25,00:00:17.75
<i>She did not look up from her tea.</i>

00:00:18.15,00:00:21.40
- Ivo, in eleven weeks[br]you have not once been right.

00:00:21.80,00:00:23.55
I was right about the gulls.

00:00:23.95,00:00:26.57
You said there were four. There were nine.

00:00:26.97,00:00:29.28
Four of them were the important ones.

00:00:29.68,00:00:33.31
- Go and look at the lamp.[br]- I am looking at it from here.

00:00:33.71,00:00:35.21
From here it looks fine.

00:00:35.61,00:00:36.81
It is off.

00:00:37.21,00:00:38.58
It looks fine and off.

00:00:38.98,00:00:40.67
<i>A long, wet silence.</i>

00:00:41.07,00:00:43.32
If a ship comes now, what do we say?

00:00:43.72,00:00:45.47
We say the lamp was resting.

00:00:45.87,00:00:48.37
- They will write that down.[br]- Let them.

00:00:48.77,00:00:50.40
They wrote down the gulls.

00:00:50.80,00:00:52.80
They wrote down four gulls, Ivo.

00:00:53.20,00:00:54.40
Nine.

00:00:54.80,00:00:56.42
- Fine. Nine.[br]- Thank you.

00:00:56.82,00:01:00.13
<i>Marta climbs the stairs. Ninety-eight of them.</i>

00:01:00.53,00:01:01.73
Ninety-eight!

00:01:02.13,00:01:04.76
It is ninety-seven. You count the landing.

00:01:05.16,00:01:06.60
The landing is a stair.

00:01:07.00,00:01:08.56
The landing is a landing.

00:01:08.96,00:01:10.16
- Marta?[br]- What.

00:01:10.56,00:01:11.76
Is it on?

00:01:12.16,00:01:14.78
<i>A pause the length of a lighthouse.</i>

00:01:15.18,00:01:16.38
It is on.

00:01:16.78,00:01:18.66
- So it was resting.[br]- Do not.

00:01:19.06,00:01:21.06
It was resting and now it is up.

00:01:21.46,00:01:22.66
Ivo.

00:01:23.06,00:01:24.75
Like a person. Like a gull.

00:01:25.15,00:01:26.65
Ivo, come and hold this.

00:01:27.05,00:01:28.36
TWO HOURS LATER

00:01:28.76,00:01:30.51
- Marta?[br]- Still holding it.
